ing the film","7. Assemble and deliver"],"name_hint":"faceless · 视频","description_zh":"创建完成的多场景旁白无出镜讲解、纪录片、教育故事、神话童话或儿童配图故事；不用于单片段、广告、UGC、真人讲话或无声动画。"},{"path":"krea-generate/SKILL.md","name":"krea-generate","description":"Use before any image, video, edit, or enhancement generation (beyond the simplest one-shot request) for model recommendations and prompting guides. Route marketing, campaign, UGC, marketplace, and paid-social work to krea-marketing.","headings":["Krea Generate - Media Generation","Bootstrap (MCP)","Universal Rules","Choosing the right model","Image models","Region-targeted edits (annotations)","Expanding images (outpainting)","Upscaling and Enhancer models","Video models","Writing the prompt","Prompting Guides","Recognize Implicit Edit Requests","Minimize edit passes (edit from the source image)","Routing","References","Related Skills","Filename Pattern"],"name_hint":"krea · 生成","description_zh":"为超出最简单单次请求的图像、视频、编辑和增强生成提供模型建议与提示指导；营销、活动、UGC、电商和付费社交素材交由krea-marketing。"},{"path":"krea-marketing/SKILL.md","name":"krea-marketing","description":"Use for marketing and paid-social creative: packaging design and mockups, product photoshoots, marketplace cards, static/UGC/video ads, campaign key visuals, ad storyboards, product launches, and Meta Ads. For generic media generation use krea-generate.","headings":["Krea Marketing - Performance-Informed Creative","Entry Intake","Meta Ads Rules","Marketing Image Model Policy","Real Product Evidence Rules","Routing","References","Delivery Discipline"],"name_hint":"krea · marketing","description_zh":"生成营销与付费社交创意，包括包装样机、产品摄影、电商卡片、静态UGC视频广告、活动主视觉、分镜、产品发布和Meta Ads；普通媒体交由krea-generate。"},{"path":"krea-motion/SKILL.md","name":"krea-motion","description":"Use for product, brand, and marketing motion: animating a product still, render, logo, or mark; reveal films; web and PDP loops. Not for anime, character, or narrative animation — use krea-generate for those. For ad creative use krea-marketing.","headings":["Krea Moti